Subject: [PATCH] dbghelp, imagehlp: SymNext/SymPrev, SymGetSymNext/Prev, enumeration W variants, home directory, FindDebugInfoFileEx, SymFind*, SymEnumProcesses (3538)

dbghelp, imagehlp: SymNext/SymPrev, SymGetSymNext/Prev, enumeration W variants, home directory, FindDebugInfoFileEx, SymFind*, SymEnumProcesses

SymGetSymNext/Prev(64) and SymNext/SymPrev(W) return the neighbouring symbol of the module by address; SymEnumSym, SymEnumerateSymbolsW(64), SymEnumSymbolsForAddr(W), SymEnumLinesW, SymGetTypeFromNameW, SymEnumProcesses; SymSetHomeDirectory/SymGetHomeDirectory (+W); FindDebugInfoFileEx(W), SymFindDebugInfoFile(W), SymFindExecutableImage(W) and the callbacks of FindExecutableImageEx(W) are honoured; SymSetParentWindow keeps the window; FindFileInPath forwards to SymFindFileInPath; imagehlp forwards the new ones.
